 calculators for smarter decisions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://toptenuae.com/search?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#homepage\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE - The Best of the UAE, Ranked\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools including VAT and gratuity calculators.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"UAE Product Reviews and Comparisons\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com#event\",\"name\":\"UAE Holidays 2026: Complete List of Public and Private Sector Dates\",\"description\":\"Planning Your Year of Travel Planning your year in the Emirates? For expats and residents, the release of the holiday calendar is the signal to start booking flights. Whether you are planning a summer escape to Europe or a winter staycation in Ras Al Khaimah, timing is everything. This guide covers the official UAE holidays in 2026, the famous \\\"Leave Hacks\\\" to double your time off, and—most importantly—where to travel during each break. Editor's Note: This guide details the predicted holiday calendar for 2026 based on astronomical calculations and the UAE Cabinet's standardized holiday framework. Islamic dates are subject to moon sighting.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/f49d76b1000e7d07af8a937b295eda3ea6631824-1200x800.webp\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-31T18:30:00.000Z\",\"endDate\":\"2026-12-31T06:30:00.000Z\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/MixedEventAttendanceMode\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"United Arab Emirates\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Dubai\",\"addressCountry\":\"AE\"}},\"organizer\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com\",\"price\":0,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"validFrom\":\"2025-12-24T01:00:38Z\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is the next long weekend in UAE 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"After New Year's Day, the next major long weekend is Eid Al Fitr, expected around March 20, 2026.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many days off for Eid Al Adha 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Residents can expect a 6-day break, starting from Arafat Day (likely May 26) through the weekend.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the longest holidays for travel in 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Eid Al-Adha (May) offers the best opportunity for long-haul travel. With just one day of annual leave, you can unlock a 9-day vacation, making it viable to travel to the USA, Japan, or Australia.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are public and private sector holidays the same in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The UAE Cabinet has unified the number of official holidays for both public and private sectors.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I travel during Ramadan 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Ramadan 2026 will be in Feb/March. Travel is often cheaper during the Holy Month before the Eid rush begins, though some services in Muslim countries may be reduced during daylight hours.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many public holidays are there in the UAE in 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"There are 7 official public holiday occasions in 2026 sanctioned by the UAE Cabinet. These include New Year's Day, Eid Al Fitr, Arafat Day, Eid Al Adha, Islamic New Year, the Prophet's Birthday, and National Day. In total, residents can expect approximately 13 days of public holidays throughout the year.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many days off for Eid Al Fitr 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Residents can typically expect a break of 3 to 4 days for Eid Al Fitr. In 2026, the holiday is predicted to fall from Friday, March 20, to Sunday, March 22. Since the holiday spans Ramadan 29 to Shawwal 3, the exact duration depends on the moon sighting, but it will likely create a long weekend.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to get more holidays in 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can maximize your time off by \\\"bridging\\\" public holidays with your annual leave. For example, during Eid Al Adha in May, the holiday falls from Tuesday to Friday. By booking just one day off (Monday, May 25), you can connect the previous weekend and enjoy a massive 9-day vacation while using only a single day of your annual leave balance.\"}}]}]}20:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2a\"}}],\"$L2b\"]\n22:null\n26:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"UAE Holidays 2026: Complete List of Public and Private... | TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Complete guide to UAE Holidays 2026: Complete List of Public and Private Sector Dates in UAE. Dates, timings, best deals, and expert recommendations