67\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" All Islamic dates are predictions. Do not book non-refundable flights for the exact days; give yourself a +/- 1-day buffer.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5568d5158f3b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f7036f3d56a7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"School Holidays:\"},{\"_key\":\"afe5f9bd29ab\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Spring break for most UAE schools is expected to align with the Eid Al-Fitr period in late March, making it the busiest travel week of Q1.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"955619d44014\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6c3623d0797f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Sector Differences:\"},{\"_key\":\"d0a982556127\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" While the UAE government typically unifies public and private sector holidays, the number of granted days can sometimes vary. Always confirm specific dates with your employer's HR policy.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"category\":{\"menuLabel\":\"What's On\",\"slug\":\"events-holidays\",\"title\":\"UAE What's On: Events, Public Holidays & Festivals 2026\"},\"closingContent\":null,\"content\":null,\"description\":null,\"endDate\":\"2026-12-31T06:30:00.000Z\",\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"0f6e5fa4a9fb\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"c8e0343646b0\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"83a1617f4335\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"After New Year's Day, the next major long weekend is Eid Al Fitr, expected around March 20, 2026.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"When is the next long weekend in UAE 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"5fca8d200a91\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"e673911061a0\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f9e2bca7a549\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Residents can expect a 6-day break, starting from Arafat Day (likely May 26) through the weekend.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How many days off for Eid Al Adha 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"e5140c662e7a\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"e8bd33927160\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"01f30699616c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Eid Al-Adha (May) offers the best opportunity for long-haul travel. With just one day of annual leave, you can unlock a 9-day vacation, making it viable to travel to the USA, Japan, or Australia.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the longest holidays for travel in 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"c59d2d8e577f\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"8b51866c59c8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"06f5b3841711\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes. The UAE Cabinet has unified the number of official holidays for both public and private sectors.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Are public and private sector holidays the same in UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"97fbe289545b\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"abfff0a03b34\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ed67f1349658\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes. Ramadan 2026 will be in Feb/March. Travel is often cheaper during the Holy Month before the Eid rush begins, though some services in Muslim countries may be reduced during daylight hours.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Can I travel during Ramadan 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"14434ce1368b\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"3c9c3282c42d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c74f6a44ca72\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"There are \"},{\"_key\":\"8f94b2ba4eaa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"7 official public holiday occasions\"},{\"_key\":\"a8ec5b4e6e1c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" in 2026 sanctioned by the UAE Cabinet. These include New Year's Day, Eid Al Fitr, Arafat Day, Eid Al Adha, Islamic New Year, the Prophet's Birthday, and National Day. In total, residents can expect approximately \"},{\"_key\":\"f7379587483a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"13 days of public holidays\"},{\"_key\":\"c585c86f1277\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" throughout the year.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How many public holidays are there in the UAE in 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"77a208e4d841\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"7078f10b01ab\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e88a84a6ce55\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Residents can typically expect a break of \"},{\"_key\":\"09c4a7d1faa8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"3 to 4 days\"},{\"_key\":\"bbfa43f94f6d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" for Eid Al Fitr. In 2026, the holiday is predicted to fall from \"},{\"_key\":\"279a00cf526d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Friday, March 20, to Sunday, March 22\"},{\"_key\":\"e2fe10f788ed\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". Since the holiday spans Ramadan 29 to Shawwal 3, the exact duration depends on the moon sighting, but it will likely create a long weekend.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How many days off for Eid Al Fitr 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"6c8c152d0928\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"0cd3e18992b7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b111c2cbacf0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"You can maximize your time off by \\\"bridging\\\" public holidays with your annual leave. For example, during \"},{\"_key\":\"f225e4757a1a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Eid Al Adha in May\"},{\"_key\":\"b23f103f6b20\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", the holiday falls from Tuesday to Friday. By booking just \"},{\"_key\":\"33e365c883da\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"one day off (Monday, May 25)\"},{\"_key\":\"31cbae71fc09\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", you can connect the previous weekend and enjoy a massive \"},{\"_key\":\"6fc667146841\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"9-day vacation\"},{\"_key\":\"d2b8687a5e76\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" while using only a single day of your annual leave balance.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How to get more holidays in 2026?\"}],\"intro\":[{\"_key\":\"60b48d02f899\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"77f92d0e49e4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Planning Your Year of Travel\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"dd1dbf1d89c1\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c75164a97698\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Planning your year in the Emirates? For expats and residents, the release of the holiday calendar is the signal to start booking flights. Whether you are planning a summer escape to Europe or a winter staycation in Ras Al Khaimah, timing is everything.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"75b5d43fab2f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e2ee35d8ca3f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"This guide covers the official \"},{\"_key\":\"0202f9664912\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"UAE holidays in 2026\"},{\"_key\":\"30a52ad0325b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", the famous \\\"Leave Hacks\\\" to double your time off, and—most importantly—\"},{\"_key\":\"9cfed47e9050\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"where to travel\"},{\"_key\":\"cff7c4841691\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" during each break.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"79218aefa20f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"62cfdaf090fa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"1a28b199dd51\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6457057f62fc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Ed